# Next.js

- App Router only.
- Server Components by default.
- Client Components only when browser APIs or interactivity are needed.
- Prefer Server Actions for local mutations from this UI.
- Use Route Handlers for external APIs, integrations, health, downloads.
- Authenticated ERP pages should not be statically cached as public content.
- Colocate feature routes under `app/(app)/...` and logic under `features/`.
